      "filename": "HMS Tyne (Pennant number P281).jpg",
      "title": "File:HMS Tyne (Pennant number P281).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/62/HMS_Tyne_%28Pennant_number_P281%29.jpg",
